WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.200 --> 00:00:01.600
Host: So, what brings you to the market today?

2
00:00:01.800 --> 00:00:04.400
Guest: Hi, I'm Amina. I come here every Saturday for the spices.

3
00:00:04.600 --> 00:00:05.600
Host: And which stall is the best?

4
00:00:05.800 --> 00:00:07.600
Guest: The one at the corner. Ask for the red pepper.
